---
const WHATSAPP_URL =
  'https://wa.me/56947185397?text=Hola%20JMKT,%20quiero%20conversar%20sobre%20c%C3%B3mo%20hacer%20crecer%20mi%20negocio%20en%20internet';
---

<section id="sobre-jmkt" class="bg-[#F8FAFC] text-[#0F172A] py-20 sm:py-24 border-t border-slate-200/70">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="rounded-3xl bg-white border border-slate-200 p-8 sm:p-12 lg:p-14 shadow-[0_12px_40px_rgba(15,23,42,0.05)] reveal">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 items-center">
        <!-- Left Agency Trust Statement -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-5">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="w-8 h-[2px] bg-[#658C00] rounded-full"></span>
            <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#4D6B00]">
              Sobre JMKT
            </span>
          </div>

          <h2 class="font-heading font-extrabold text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl leading-[1.15] tracking-tight text-[#0F172A] text-balance">
            Impulsamos negocios locales y PyMEs en Chile con herramientas digitales que antes solo estaban al alcance de grandes empresas.
          </h2>

          <p class="text-base text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            Trabajamos con trato directo, plazos claros y enfoque comercial real: desde tu perfil en Google Maps hasta sitios web optimizados y agentes de Inteligencia Artificial que atienden a tus clientes sin descanso.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Right Founder & Action Card -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-5">
          <div class="rounded-2xl bg-[#0D1321] text-white p-6 sm:p-7 border border-slate-800 space-y-5">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
              <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-[#131B2E] border border-[#D4FF00]/40 flex items-center justify-center font-heading font-extrabold text-xl text-[#D4FF00] shrink-0">
                JM
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="font-heading font-bold text-lg text-white leading-tight">
                  Jamiro Manríquez
                </p>
                <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#D4FF00] mt-1">
                  Fundador & Estratega Digital
                </p>
                <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1">
                  Peñaflor, Región Metropolitana · Chile
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="pt-4 border-t border-slate-800 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3">
              <a
                href={WHATSAPP_URL}
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                class="flex-1 inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-5 py-3.5 rounded-full bg-[#D4FF00] hover:bg-[#CCFF00] text-[#070B14] font-heading font-bold text-sm transition-colors"
              >
                <span>Conversemos por WhatsApp</span>
                <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
              </a>
              <a
                href="/contacto"
                class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-5 py-3.5 rounded-full border border-slate-700 hover:border-white text-slate-200 hover:text-white font-heading font-semibold text-sm transition-colors"
              >
                Tarjeta digital
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
